(7451560, 1179455, 1686, '<td valign="top">The pic is a composite of 4 pictures.<br/>One of the plate with chips peppers, beer and silverware<br/>Second one with hot dog propped up on bamboo skewers over the plate with sauerkraut suspended on a thin knife blade<br/>Third is the mustard bottle<br/>Fourth is the bottle with a stream of mustard coming out<br/>Each of the latter three were masked to isolate one feature which then were moved into position<br/>All 4 were taken outside in bright sunlight to give sharp shadow and high contrast</td>', 'The pic is a composite of 4 pictures.One of the plate with chips peppers, beer and silverwareSecond one with hot dog propped up on bamboo skewers over the plate with sauerkraut suspended on a thin knife bladeThird is the mustard bottleFourth is the bottle with a stream of mustard coming outEach of the latter three were masked to isolate one feature which then were moved into positionAll 4 were taken outside in bright sunlight to give sharp shadow and high contrast', '2016-04-23 03:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
